{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261006161624_b20d2afb","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_2d1a667e1bd963bc26d3fc6d","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006161624_b20d2afb","chunk_index":16,"job_id":"mwjob_5f1bc3199964d95fa63f91f8","precondition_digest":"a152920577fe3f6cd0dd4d514ed3426624fe83e1be3d143cacd52d1c030f8204","project_id":"proj_user_a67458cd1359","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_28ee6938d529ff23","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_30c898e53620010f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_991c3f73827f3309","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_81ec503bb1e44628"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006161624_b20d2afb","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"II期概念验证：三组各60例共180例；按NRS组间差1.0分、SD 2.0、α=0.05双侧、80%把握度探索性设定。","quote_sha256":"e62bfec01431121d019004bb3b3c086441b56253f1c4ff60718f4a1557690d02","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_001"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_a18e0421704cd8b4:full-draft:b75fe4332030aec7d7602eb9","quote":"II期概念验证：三组各60例共180例；按NRS组间差1.0分、SD 2.0、α=0.05双侧、80%把握度探索性设定。","quote_sha256":"e62bfec01431121d019004bb3b3c086441b56253f1c4ff60718f4a1557690d02","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:b75fe4332030aec7d7602eb9","span_id":"es_002"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照加活性对照的II期设计；KZ-PHN902每日两次口服，三组（100mg、200mg、普瑞巴林活性对照），治疗8周。","quote_sha256":"5ebd13070034ff83511bddb08013d85e08018c543059862255b76021107cc93e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_010"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"安慰剂与普瑞巴林活性对照双对照；三组1:1:1，双盲双模拟。","quote_sha256":"e301afe88ba70cf93405c6cb75cc921683b2b37536680346cfb03f619c864233","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_013"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_001","es_002","es_010","es_013"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[],"heading":"样本量","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为II期概念验证及剂量探索研究，采用多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照加活性对照设计，设KZ-PHN902 100mg组、KZ-PHN902 200mg组和普瑞巴林活性对照组，三组按1:1:1比例随机分配，双盲双模拟。样本量依据主要终点第8周24小时平均疼痛NRS评分较基线变化进行估算，假设KZ-PHN902各剂量组与安慰剂组之间NRS组间差为1.0分，合并标准差为2.0，双侧显著性水平α=0.05，统计把握度80%，据此计算每组需60例，三组合计180例。上述参数为探索性设定，旨在为后续确证性研究提供剂量-效应初步证据，不作为注册性确证依据。本研究不计划样本量再估计，不设置期中分析，不设立独立数据监查委员会或安全审查委员会。","rationale":"样本量参数（三组各60例共180例、NRS组间差1.0分、SD 2.0、α=0.05双侧、80%把握度、探索性设定）及设计特征（三组1:1:1、双盲双模拟、无样本量再估计、无期中分析、无DMC/SRC）均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。需医学经理确认：是否需在方案中补充脱落率假设或实际入组目标数；探索性设定的表述是否需进一步限定适用范围。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（样本量）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_28ee6938d529ff23","section_number":"9.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b75fe4332030aec7d7602eb9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2bfb4cb52d6d07","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006161624_b20d2afb","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"主要终点MMRM（治疗组、访视、交互、基线NRS、中心）；FAS主分析；KZ-PHN902两剂量vs安慰剂Holm；活性对照描述性比较；SS安全描述。","quote_sha256":"dd064f02300c7e3e51203ad26764a4df4cad125a71d8730900cfd589171351a8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"治疗政策策略：主要终点为第8周24h平均NRS自基线变化；急救对乙酰氨基酚不改变归属；脱落不替换按ITT入FAS。","quote_sha256":"30e99fdc225a2c7a125e968b39bdadb8557e08f76ebfd1b6cb52b16facbd7949","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_004"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_003","es_004"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索本项目SAP草案或统计章节完整定义条款","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_92_01","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划"],"target":"SS精确定义（至少一次给药 vs 其他标准）"},{"action":"由医学经理与统计负责人确认是否保留PPS","category":"decision_pending","gap_id":"gap_92_02","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"是否设置PPS作为敏感性分析集"}],"heading":"统计分析数据集","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划（SAP）中数据集精确定义","方案中FAS/SS/PPS完整定义条款"],"proposal_text":"本研究设立以下统计分析数据集。全分析集（FAS）：采用意向性治疗原则，所有经随机化分配的受试者均纳入FAS，无论其是否实际接受研究药物或完成治疗；因急救对乙酰氨基酚使用或治疗期间脱落不改变其FAS归属，脱落受试者不替换。FAS为有效性主要分析集，主要终点及关键次要终点分析均基于FAS。安全性分析集（SS）：至少接受一次研究药物（KZ-PHN902或普瑞巴林）的受试者纳入SS，安全性数据描述性分析基于SS。本研究不设置符合方案集（PPS）作为主要分析集。","rationale":"FAS采用ITT原则、急救对乙酰氨基酚不改变归属、脱落不替换按ITT入FAS、SS用于安全描述等框架来自当前项目已确认研究事实。需医学经理确认：SS的精确定义（是否以至少接受一次研究药物为界）需与统计团队及方案定稿一致；是否需补充PPS作为敏感性分析集；FAS中是否排除随机化后未接受任何治疗且无任何有效性数据的受试者。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_30c898e53620010f","section_number":"9.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b75fe4332030aec7d7602eb9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2bfb4cb52d6d07","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006161624_b20d2afb","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"主要终点MMRM（治疗组、访视、交互、基线NRS、中心）；FAS主分析；KZ-PHN902两剂量vs安慰剂Holm；活性对照描述性比较；SS安全描述。","quote_sha256":"dd064f02300c7e3e51203ad26764a4df4cad125a71d8730900cfd589171351a8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"治疗政策策略：主要终点为第8周24h平均NRS自基线变化；急救对乙酰氨基酚不改变归属；脱落不替换按ITT入FAS。","quote_sha256":"30e99fdc225a2c7a125e968b39bdadb8557e08f76ebfd1b6cb52b16facbd7949","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"section:8 统计学考虑|block:1056|chunk:1","quote":"有效性评价、安全性评价、PK 评价、PD 评价、免疫原性评价以及其他分析将在本研究的统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，数据库锁定前将最终确定 SAP。","quote_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"访视策略：筛选、基线、第2/4/8周、安全随访；电子疼痛日记每日NRS记录。","quote_sha256":"bebbc02600c20a056fa50c49f78b2590eff65c72150fac1c48f586cfaf64f4a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_009"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：第8周24小时平均疼痛NRS评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"30c910291493d13362fd2531811021bf2ef27588db762f8f66a789c09dac2ec4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_011"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"关键次要终点：第8周NRS较基线下降≥30%/≥50%应答率、睡眠干扰评分（NRS-SI）、PGIC。","quote_sha256":"f0c1218e627792e6e2623abf9fda337ade83863c32076e077e50e02a4ff5adc5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_012"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_003","es_004","es_007","es_009","es_011","es_012"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索SAP草案中次要终点分析章节","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_93_01","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划"],"target":"NRS-SI和PGIC的具体统计模型及多重性调整"},{"action":"检索SAP草案中缺失数据处理章节","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_93_02","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划"],"target":"电子疼痛日记连续缺失天数阈值及MMRM缺失数据处理策略"}],"heading":"统计分析一般原则","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划（SAP）中次要终点具体分析方法","电子日记缺失数据处理规则"],"proposal_text":"主要终点为第8周24小时平均疼痛NRS评分较基线的变化，采用混合效应模型重复测量（MMRM）进行分析，模型固定效应包括治疗组、访视、治疗组与访视的交互项、基线NRS评分及研究中心，随机效应为受试者内重复测量协方差结构。主要分析基于FAS，以第8周为最终访视点。KZ-PHN902 100mg组和200mg组分别与安慰剂组比较，采用Holm法控制多重比较的家族错误率；普瑞巴林活性对照组与KZ-PHN902各剂量组之间为描述性比较，不进行假设检验。关键次要终点包括第8周NRS较基线下降≥30%和≥50%的应答率、睡眠干扰评分（NRS-SI）及患者总体印象变化（PGIC），其分析方法及多重性调整策略将在统计分析计划中详细规定。有效性评价、安全性评价及其他分析的具体方法将在统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，SAP于数据库锁定前最终确定。","rationale":"主要终点（第8周24h平均NRS较基线变化）、MMRM模型结构（治疗组、访视、交互、基线NRS、中心）、FAS主分析、Holm法、活性对照描述性比较、关键次要终点（NRS应答率、NRS-SI、PGIC）及SAP最终确定时点均来自当前项目已确认研究事实及公司语料结构参照。需医学经理确认：NRS-SI和PGIC的具体分析方法（如是否采用CMH或Logistic回归）；关键次要终点是否纳入多重性调整；电子疼痛日记每日NRS记录在MMRM中的缺失数据处理规则。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_991c3f73827f3309","section_number":"9.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b75fe4332030aec7d7602eb9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2bfb4cb52d6d07","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006161624_b20d2afb","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"安全性终点：不良事件（头晕、嗜睡、步态异常）、生命体征、心电图、实验室。","quote_sha256":"ebbfdafe46df31de2fff98d3ff2dc429809e9376fa85b71b9019b36902703004","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"研究时期：筛选2周；双盲治疗8周；安全随访2周。","quote_sha256":"9bd5fd21a15316c3c80d6126372a72eccba8ebc6cda070fd09f4c7804cff1c7a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:29|chunk:1","quote":"记录不良医学事件：自试验参与者签署知情同意书至首次使用研究药物前，由试验参与者报告或研究者观察到的任何不良的医疗事件，无论与试验药物是否有因果关系，均判为安全性信息而非不良事件，需作为病史记录在原始病历中；首次使用研究药物后的所有不良医疗事件作为AE记录。整个研究期间均需记录。","quote_sha256":"11c21094429a4d9b6fd36d28e6d6b787c134a8c7397ecc704a35c832857515fe","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","span_id":"es_008"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"访视策略：筛选、基线、第2/4/8周、安全随访；电子疼痛日记每日NRS记录。","quote_sha256":"bebbc02600c20a056fa50c49f78b2590eff65c72150fac1c48f586cfaf64f4a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_009"},{"locator":"section:14 附录 100|block:198|chunk:1","quote":"本研究将完全按照ICH E6和我国GCP指导原则、赫尔辛基宣言、相关法律法规及伦理委员会审核意见进行，以提供并加强对个人的保护。本研究将符合ICH E2A指导原则（临床安全性数据管理：加速报告的定义和标准）。","quote_sha256":"12bac064fee816df622f65bd2f3d65dab5b33e902aa7b25ae49db87726080ac4","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","span_id":"es_014"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_005","es_006","es_008","es_009","es_014"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索本项目安全性管理计划或方案安全性章节完整条款","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_95_01","missing_source_classes":["项目安全性管理文件","ICH E2A项目适用性说明"],"target":"AE/SAE/SUSAR定义、因果关系判定标准、报告时限及报告对象"},{"action":"检索方案访视流程表及安全性评估操作规范","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_95_02","missing_source_classes":["方案访视流程","安全性评估操作规范"],"target":"生命体征、心电图、实验室检查的采集时点及异常判定阈值"},{"action":"检索研究者手册及非临床安全性摘要","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_95_03","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册","非临床安全性报告"],"target":"KZ-PHN902已知或潜在安全性风险（来自IB或非临床数据）"}],"heading":"安全性数据分析","missing_source_classes":["本项目AE/SAE/SUSAR定义及报告规则文件","安全性评估具体操作规范（采集时点、阈值）","研究者手册中安全性风险描述"],"proposal_text":"安全性分析基于安全性分析集（SS），采用描述性方法。安全性评价内容包括不良事件（重点关注头晕、嗜睡、步态异常等神经系统相关事件）、生命体征、心电图及实验室检查。不良事件的记录遵循以下原则：自受试者签署知情同意书至首次使用研究药物前出现的不良医疗事件作为病史记录，首次使用研究药物后出现的不良医疗事件作为不良事件记录，整个研究期间均需记录。安全性数据的收集、报告及加速报告遵循ICH E2A指导原则（临床安全性数据管理：加速报告的定义和标准）及我国相关法规要求。安全性随访期为双盲治疗结束后2周，访视安排包括第2周、第4周、第8周治疗期访视及安全随访访视。","rationale":"安全性终点（AE含头晕/嗜睡/步态异常、生命体征、心电图、实验室）、SS描述性分析、安全随访2周、访视策略（第2/4/8周及安全随访）来自当前项目已确认研究事实。AE记录窗口（ICF签署至首次用药前为病史、首次用药后为AE）及ICH E2A引用来自公司语料通用原则参照。需医学经理确认：AE/SAE/SUSAR在本项目中的具体定义、因果关系判定标准、报告时限及报告对象；生命体征、心电图、实验室检查的具体采集时点及异常判定阈值；安全性随访2周内的具体评估项目。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_81ec503bb1e44628","section_number":"9.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b75fe4332030aec7d7602eb9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2bfb4cb52d6d07","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"38c32c32df3584004a68c6979fe0a243a1bd3c4e1b731dabf8272a09b565ea37","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_a18e0421704cd8b4:full-draft:b75fe4332030aec7d7602eb9","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:b75fe4332030aec7d7602eb9","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:a152920577fe3f6cd0dd4d514ed3426624fe83e1be3d143cacd52d1c030f8204:b75fe4332030aec7d7602eb9","text_sha256":"38c32c32df3584004a68c6979fe0a243a1bd3c4e1b731dabf8272a09b565ea37"},{"content_sha256":"8ac76f6f006a3f528aebf01a5d650a62e945d42e846872e07315a6ec091b0478","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","text_sha256":"8ac76f6f006a3f528aebf01a5d650a62e945d42e846872e07315a6ec091b0478"},{"content_sha256":"9a9f3dc0d904c2d48a939e7baaaaf39c4e89deb4067ed241f98001500d36bd56","locator":"section:参考文献：|block:48|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"3152bfe8bf762f","text_sha256":"9a9f3dc0d904c2d48a939e7baaaaf39c4e89deb4067ed241f98001500d36bd56"},{"content_sha256":"85c12adb57d7e4840e02d045e114b2097ce5d40213d4a0f4198e48166b460b6a","locator":"section:评价CMS-D001在中度至重度特应性皮炎患者中的有效性和安全性的多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照的Ⅱ期临床研究|block:42|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2bfb4cb52d6d07","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"2bfb4cb52d6d07","text_sha256":"85c12adb57d7e4840e02d045e114b2097ce5d40213d4a0f4198e48166b460b6a"},{"content_sha256":"12bac064fee816df622f65bd2f3d65dab5b33e902aa7b25ae49db87726080ac4","locator":"section:14 附录 100|block:198|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"20561fabeffbb0","text_sha256":"12bac064fee816df622f65bd2f3d65dab5b33e902aa7b25ae49db87726080ac4"},{"content_sha256":"11c21094429a4d9b6fd36d28e6d6b787c134a8c7397ecc704a35c832857515fe","locator":"section:文档开头|block:29|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"04ac0381ef4b49","text_sha256":"11c21094429a4d9b6fd36d28e6d6b787c134a8c7397ecc704a35c832857515fe"},{"content_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03","locator":"section:8 统计学考虑|block:1056|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"a3cf98aab983c7","text_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03"}]}